{"unit_id":"tag:0EYS:statement","translation":"考虑概形（schemes）的笛卡尔（cartesian）图（diagram）\n<MATH_0001>\n，其中<MATH_0002>平坦（flat）且局部有限表现（locally of finite presentation），具有几何约化（reduced）的纤维（fibres）。那么<MATH_0003>对于任意层（sheaf）<MATH_0004>（位于<MATH_0005>上）成立。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"cartesian","target_term":"笛卡尔"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"locally of finite presentation","target_term":"局部有限表现"},{"source_term":"reduced","target_term":"约化"},{"source_term":"fibres","target_term":"纤维"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"基变换图"},{"source_term":"cartesian","target_term":"笛卡尔","context":"图的性质"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图","context":"基变换图"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"态射假设"},{"source_term":"locally of finite presentation","target_term":"局部有限表现","context":"态射假设"},{"source_term":"reduced","target_term":"约化","context":"几何纤维性质"},{"source_term":"fibres","target_term":"纤维","context":"态射纤维"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"推前的对象"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0EZY:statement","translation":"考虑概形（schemes）的笛卡尔（cartesian）图（diagrams）\n<MATH_0001>\n。假设<MATH_0002>是一个可分闭（separably closed）域（field）的谱（spectrum）。那么<MATH_0003>对于任意层（sheaf）<MATH_0004>（位于<MATH_0005>上）成立。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"cartesian","target_term":"笛卡尔"},{"source_term":"diagrams","target_term":"图"},{"source_term":"separably closed","target_term":"可分闭"},{"source_term":"field","target_term":"域"},{"source_term":"spectrum","target_term":"谱"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"基变换图"},{"source_term":"cartesian","target_term":"笛卡尔","context":"图的性质"},{"source_term":"diagrams","target_term":"图","context":"基变换图"},{"source_term":"separably closed","target_term":"可分闭","context":"域的假设"},{"source_term":"field","target_term":"域","context":"基底"},{"source_term":"spectrum","target_term":"谱","context":"基底概形"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"推前的对象"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0EZY:proof","translation":"可以在<MATH_0001>上局部地工作。因此可假设<MATH_0002>仿射（affine）。于是可以将<MATH_0003>写成在<MATH_0004>上有限型（finite type）的仿射概形（affine schemes）的余滤过（cofiltered）极限（limit）。由引理<REF_0001>，可以假设<MATH_0005>在<MATH_0006>上有限型（finite type）。此时引理<REF_0002>适用，因为任何在可分闭（separably closed）域（field）上有限型（finite type）的概形（scheme），都是连通（connected）且几何连通（geometrically connected）的概形（schemes）的有限（finite）不交并（disjoint union）（见《代数簇（Varieties）》，引理<REF_0003>）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射"},{"source_term":"finite type","target_term":"有限型"},{"source_term":"affine schemes","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"cofiltered","target_term":"余滤过"},{"source_term":"limit","target_term":"极限"},{"source_term":"finite type","target_term":"有限型"},{"source_term":"separably closed","target_term":"可分闭"},{"source_term":"field","target_term":"域"},{"source_term":"finite type","target_term":"有限型"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"connected","target_term":"连通"},{"source_term":"geometrically connected","target_term":"几何连通"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"disjoint union","target_term":"不交并"},{"source_term":"Varieties","target_term":"代数簇"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射","context":"局部化"},{"source_term":"finite type","target_term":"有限型","context":"极限系统及归约"},{"source_term":"affine schemes","target_term":"仿射概形","context":"极限系统"},{"source_term":"cofiltered","target_term":"余滤过","context":"极限的指标"},{"source_term":"limit","target_term":"极限","context":"仿射表示"},{"source_term":"separably closed","target_term":"可分闭","context":"基底域"},{"source_term":"field","target_term":"域","context":"基底"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"有限型对象"},{"source_term":"connected","target_term":"连通","context":"分支性质"},{"source_term":"geometrically connected","target_term":"几何连通","context":"分支性质"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","conte