{"unit_id":"tag:0EZZ:statement","translation":"考虑概形（schemes）的笛卡尔（cartesian）图（diagram）\n<MATH_0001>\n。假设\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0002>平坦（flat）且为开（open）的，\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0003>的剩余域（residue fields）可分代数闭（separably algebraically closed），\n<STRUCT_0004> 给定平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）态射（morphism）<MATH_0004>，其中<MATH_0005>仿射（affine），可以将<MATH_0006>写成<MATH_0007>的开子概形（open subschemes）的有限（finite）不交并（disjoint union）（例如，若<MATH_0008>是一个正规（normal）整（integral）概形（scheme），其函数（function）域（field）可分闭（separably closed）），\n<STRUCT_0005> 纤维（fibre）<MATH_0009>（属于<MATH_0010>）的任意非空开集（nonempty open）都是连通（connected）的（例如，若<MATH_0011>不可约（irreducible）或为空（empty））。\n<STRUCT_0006>\n那么，对于任意层（sheaf）<MATH_0012>，它取值于集合（sets）且位于<MATH_0013>上，有<MATH_0014>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"cartesian","target_term":"笛卡尔"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"open","target_term":"开"},{"source_term":"residue fields","target_term":"剩余域"},{"source_term":"separably algebraically closed","target_term":"可分代数闭"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射"},{"source_term":"open subschemes","target_term":"开子概形"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"disjoint union","target_term":"不交并"},{"source_term":"normal","target_term":"正规"},{"source_term":"integral","target_term":"整"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"function","target_term":"函数"},{"source_term":"field","target_term":"域"},{"source_term":"separably closed","target_term":"可分闭"},{"source_term":"fibre","target_term":"纤维"},{"source_term":"nonempty open","target_term":"非空开集"},{"source_term":"connected","target_term":"连通"},{"source_term":"irreducible","target_term":"不可约"},{"source_term":"empty","target_term":"空"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"}],"u